  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "審計學",
    "sub_ename": "AUDITING",
    "describe_ch": "審計學是牽涉很廣的一門綜合應用科學，研習審計除了理論及程序外，在於了解審計本身之超然獨立性與正義感。期望學生能通曉審計學理與國內外差異，培養思辨篤行之習性，維護社會公益之使命感。",
    "describe_eh": "this course is designed primary for modern auditing theory and concepts with methodology and practice. In addition, emphasis is given to professional responsibilities of auditors in upholding the integrity, objective and independence of the financial reporting process, Teaching Goals: introduction to auditing, its meaning and importance, Prepare students for auditing practices and other theories relating to auditing",
    "pre_subname": "ACCT1011會計學(一)、ACCT1012會計學(二)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "ACCT1011",
    "pre_sub_ename": "ACCT1011 ACCOUNTING(1)、ACCT1012 ACCOUNTING(2)",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
